{"strongs": "H5523", "word": "סֻכּוֺת", "translit": "suk.kot", "root": "סכות", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name, of a location; — 1.", "gloss": "booths", "definition": "סֻכּוֺת 18 proper name, of a location; — 1. סֻכֹּ֫תָה ( ה locative) Gen 33:17 (twice in verse) ( J ; explanation from Jacob's making booths ), elsewhere סֻכּוֺת ; — city east of Jordan Judg 8:5 + 6 t. Judg 8 ; Josh 13:27 ( P ); probably also 1Kgs 7:46 = 2Chr 4:17 (reading מַעְכֶּרֶת אֲדָמָה ford of Adamah GFM Judg 7:22 compare Buhl Geogr. 206 Benz 1Kgs 7:46 ); ׳ עֵמֶק ס Ps 60:8 = Ps 108:8 is Jordan-valley near succôth ; on identify. compare GFM Judg 8:5 Buhl Geogr. 260 GASm Geogr. 585 , and references; according to Talmud Dêr `alla , 1 mile north of Jabbok Nbr Geogr. du Talm. 248 , so S. Merrill East of Jordan 385 ff. ; ᵐ5 Σοκχωθ ( Σκηναί Gen 33 compare Psalms). 2. סֻכֹּ֫תָה ( ה locative) Exod 12:37 , elsewhere סֻכֹּת ; — first station of Israel at Exodus, Exod 12:37 ; Exod 13:20 ; Num 33:5 ; Num 33:6 (all P ); = Egyptian Thku(t) WMM As.u.Eur.70 , Thkw Steind BAS i. 603 ; on site see Naville Pithom (1885), especially pp. 6. 23 f. Guthe ZPV viii (1885), 219 f. ; ᵐ5 Σοκχωθ .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5583')\">BDB5583</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5523')\">H5523</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5582')\">BDB5582</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5584')\">BDB5584</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>סֻכּוֺת</bdbheb><sub>18</sub> <div class=\"point\"><b>proper name, of a location; — 1.</b> <bdbheb>סֻכֹּ֫תָה</bdbheb> (<bdbheb>ה</bdbheb> locative) <ref ref=\"Gen 33:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,33,17)\">Gen 33:17</ref> (twice in verse) (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; explanation from Jacob's making <highlight>booths</highlight>), elsewhere <bdbheb>סֻכּוֺת</bdbheb>; — city east of Jordan <ref ref=\"Judg 8:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,5)\">Judg 8:5</ref> + 6 t. <ref ref=\"Judg 8\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,1)\">Judg 8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 13:27\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(6,13,27)\">Josh 13:27</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); probably also <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:46\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"46\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"46\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,46)\">1Kgs 7:46</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 4:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,4,17)\">2Chr 4:17</ref> (reading <bdbheb>מַעְכֶּרֶת אֲדָמָה</bdbheb> <highlight>ford of Adamah</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GFM')\">GFM<sup><ref ref=\"Judg 7:22\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(7,7,22)\">Judg 7:22</ref></sup></lookup> compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>Geogr. 206</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Benz')\">Benz<sup><ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:46\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"46\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"46\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,46)\">1Kgs 7:46</ref></sup></lookup>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עֵמֶק ס</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 60:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,60,8)\">Ps 60:8</ref> = <ref ref=\"Ps 108:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"108\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"108\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,108,8)\">Ps 108:8</ref> is Jordan-valley near <highlight>succôth</highlight>; on identify. compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GFM')\">GFM<sup><ref ref=\"Judg 8:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,5)\">Judg 8:5</ref></sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>Geogr. 260</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GASm')\">GASm<sup>Geogr. 585</sup></lookup>, and references; according to Talmud <highlight>Dêr `alla</highlight>, 1 mile north of Jabbok <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Nbr')\">Nbr<sup>Geogr. du Talm. 248</sup></lookup>, so S. Merrill<sup>East of Jordan 385 ff.</sup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Σοκχωθ</grk> (<grk>Σκηναί</grk> <ref ref=\"Gen 33\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(1,33,1)\">Gen 33</ref> compare Psalms).</p></div><div class=\"section\"><p> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <bdbheb>סֻכֹּ֫תָה</bdbheb> (<bdbheb>ה</bdbheb> locative) <ref ref=\"Exod 12:37\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(2,12,37)\">Exod 12:37</ref>, elsewhere <bdbheb>סֻכֹּת</bdbheb>; — first station of Israel at Exodus, <ref ref=\"Exod 12:37\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(2,12,37)\">Exod 12:37</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 13:20\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(2,13,20)\">Exod 13:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 33:5\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(4,33,5)\">Num 33:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 33:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,33,6)\">Num 33:6</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); = Egyptian <transliteration><highlight>Thku(t)</highlight></transliteration> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('WMM')\">WMM<sup>As.u.Eur.70</sup></lookup>, <highlight>Thkw</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Steind')\">Steind<sup>BAS i. 603</sup></lookup>; on site see Naville<sup>Pithom (1885),</sup> especially pp. 6. 23 f. Guthe<sup>ZPV viii (1885), 219 f.</sup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Σοκχωθ</grk>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 33:17", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 33, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Judg 8:5", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 8, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Judg 8", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 8, "verse": 1, "chapterEnd": 8, "verseEnd": 200}, {"raw": "Josh 13:27", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 13, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "1Kgs 7:46", "book": "